<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The notification small icon. capacitor.config.ts has referenced ic_stat_icon
  since it was written and the resource never existed, so every notification
  this app has posted fell back to the platform default.

  Android draws a small icon as a silhouette: it keeps the alpha and throws the
  colours away, so this is the monochrome mark at 24dp. The viewport stays 108
  and the mark keeps its safe-zone inset, which reads as generous padding at
  status-bar size - correct, because a small icon touching its own bounds looks
  cramped beside the system's own.
-->
